palaceOfDreams.onVisitedMessage:
{Palace of Dreams}

The dreamkeeper bows politely.

"You have already played today, dreamer. Let your soul rest—and return tomorrow with fresh hopes."

rewards.message:
{Palace of Dreams}

You offer 1,000 gold and the dreamkeeper unlocks a glowing chest...

But it vanishes into mist — no reward this time. Dreams are fickle.

{Palace of Dreams}

You hand over 1,000 gold. The chest opens with a whisper...

Inside lie shimmering resources, glinting like echoes of forgotten dreams.

{Palace of Dreams}

1,000 gold is paid. The air shimmers as the chest creaks open...

A wondrous artifact lies within. A small dream fulfilled.

{Palace of Dreams}

You offer 1,000 gold and the dreamkeeper smiles. The chest opens...

A rare artifact appears—and as a gift, your gold is returned. A true stroke of luck!

{Palace of Dreams}

You step forward, gold in hand. The chest bursts with radiant light...

A powerful artifact and a heap of gold await you. JACKPOT! Even the stars applaud your dream today!
